      "assessment": "R3 synthesis chooses [7,5,6,5], [7,6,6,5], [7,5,5,5], [5,5,6,5], a useful compact set with three interpretable same-wave contrasts. It nevertheless mixes G3's r02-to-r03 -0.0558 with other groups' incumbent-minus-latest values, propagates the 0.03 threshold, and describes Top10 as flat although the low-early group fell to 7.11083. R4 Means are 4.190014, 4.188928, 4.189977, 4.164944.",
      "decision_update": "Use a comparator-labelled evidence table for the council and prioritize comparisons among the four actual common-parent arms. Preserve the compact contrast design; distinguish poor execution of an unselected hypothesis from its absence. Reflect both the 0.02507 early-window finite-population contrast and the nearly null later-window contrasts without declaring broad invariance.",
      "counterexample_or_limitation": "The R4 early-window contrast has nonzero average benefit, while the second/third-window differences are very small in this context. This conditional observation does not prove universal timing optimality, and it cannot erase the earlier tail failures or establish improved unconditional generation.",
